    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu wadiŋi nakuhosha nanami wenjili cheŋi, wantonesheli neyi chatoneshaŋawu muntu namutulu twindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋihula nindi, Wunamonidi? Nami, Namoni hikudi inoŋu dawuru hohu dejima, nilupasa lwadu hewulu; nimanoŋu adu atanu nayedi hewulu, kumanoŋu ejima adi hewulu kudi nyiyeŋu yitanu nayiyedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi ninyiolive yiyedi kwakwihi, wumu kumbadi yalupasa yachidiilu, wukwawu kumbadi yalu yachimunswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukwakula, hinukumwihula kaŋelu wadiŋi nakuhosha nanami, nami, Eyi Mwanta wami, yeniyi hiyumanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu wadiŋi nakuhosha nanami hakwakula, hakuŋila nindi, Komana yumiyi hiwunayilukuku? Nami, Eŋa Mwanta wami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakwakula, hakuŋila nindi, Didu izu daYehova dakuleja Zerubabeli, nindi, Hichanjita hela chaŋovuku, chiŋa chaSpiritu yami hohu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi lupidi lweneni, yeyinyi? Kumesu aZerubabeli wakela chana. Yena wakedisha ilola dakunamutu, wakadibidika nindi, Luwi, luwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova hidikwinza nawa cheŋi kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Makasa aZerubabeli diwu aalili chikuku chetalidi; makasindi nawa diwu akadimanisha; nineyi wakeluka neyi, Yehova wamazaza diyi nantemeshi kudenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntwinyi nadiwuli ifuku dyuma yanyanya? Wenawa mesu atanu nayedi, wowu mesu aYehova, ayaloŋa lufuchi niniku niniku mwahita iseki dejima, akazaŋalala, akamona kuchikasa chaZerubabeli mwonji wakuzenzeleka wakweseka nachu itala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami hinukwakula, hinukumwihula nami, Iyi nyiolive yiyedi yidi kumbadi yenoŋu yakuchidiilu, nikumbadi yadu yakuchimunswa, hiyumanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukuhosha kamuchiyedi, hinukumwihula nami, Iyi nyitayi yanyiolive yidi kwakwihi nanyiyeŋu yawuru yiyedi mudi nakuhuŋunuka manji awuru, hiyumanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakuŋakula nindi, Komana yumiyi hiwunayilukuku? Nami, Eŋa Mwanta wami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Wenawa wowu ayedi awayishawu dehi manji, emanaŋa kwakwihi naMwanta weseki dejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
